day8_prep/snapshots/
day8_prep/snapshot_log.txt
*.log

# --- Individuals' names and phone numbers (DECISIONS.md 2026-10-16) ---
# Public NPPES data, but these files carry authorized officials' names,
# titles and phone numbers that nothing in the app needs. Kept locally;
# regenerate with explore_sources.py / day2 pull scripts if required.
day2/wa_pharmacies_full_flat.csv
# Superseded 1,200-record Day 2 sample (predates the 2026-07-18
